# systemd 유닛 — DGX 상시 서비스(부팅 자동시작 + 크래시 자동복구).
# 설치:
#   sudo cp guardrail-ner.service /etc/systemd/system/
#   printf 'INSTANCE_API_KEY=<키>\nNER_THRESHOLD=0.4\n' > ~/Desktop/guardrail-ner/guardrail.env
#   chmod 600 ~/Desktop/guardrail-ner/guardrail.env
#   sudo systemctl daemon-reload && sudo systemctl enable --now guardrail-ner
# 운영: systemctl status|restart guardrail-ner · journalctl -u guardrail-ner -f
[Unit]
Description=Guardrail PII NER service (medi-back)
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=nam
WorkingDirectory=/srv/guardrail-ner
EnvironmentFile=/srv/guardrail-ner/guardrail.env
ExecStart=/srv/github/openlaw-etl/.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn serve:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8090
Restart=always
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
